Instruction: Update the C++ code below to generate a Fibonacci sequence of up to the 6th number.
Input: #include <iostream>

int main ()
{
int x = 0, y = 1;
std::cout << x << " " << y;

return 0;
}

Implementation:
```python
#include <iostream>

int main ()
{
    int x = 0, y = 1, z = 0;
    std::cout << x << " " << y;
    for (int i = 0; i < 6; i++) {
        z = x + y;
        x = y;
        y = z; 
        std::cout << " " << z;
    }

    return 0;
}
```

